flowchart LR
  User[Engineer or application] --> CLI[rubixdb.exe CLI / GUI]
  User --> Web[Browser console]
  App[FastAPI / Express / Django / Python / Node] --> HTTP[HTTP API]
  CLI --> HTTP
  Web --> HTTP
  HTTP --> API[Axum rubixdb-api route layer]
  API --> SQL[rubixdb-sql]
  API --> KV[KV / range / snapshot routes]
  SQL --> Core[rubixdb core]
  KV --> Core
  Core --> WAL[WAL]
  Core --> Mem[Memtables]
  Core --> SST[SSTables]
  Core --> Catalog[Catalog and relational store]
